ambient-cpal

A renamed, vendored copy of handy-cpal 0.18.2 from crates.io
(upstream: https://github.com/handy-computer/cpal (a fork of RustAudio/cpal)), published by the Handy project
(https://github.com/cjpais/Handy). Licensed under Apache-2.0; the full license
text is in LICENSE in this directory.

Ambient owns and maintains this copy. Changes from the published crate: the
crate and library were renamed to ambient-cpal / ambient_cpal, references to the
upstream project were reworded, registry metadata (.cargo_vcs_info.json,
Cargo.toml.orig, Cargo.lock) and upstream CI/Docker files were removed, and
crates in this directory depend on each other by path.
